<title>USA: N.Y. certificated cotton stocks rise to 207,844.</title>
<headline>N.Y. certificated cotton stocks rise to 207,844.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Certificated cotton stocks deliverable against New York Cotton Exchange's No. 2 cotton futures contract as of March 26 totaled 207,844 bales, up from 205,223 bales the previous session.</p>
<p>There were 2,621 bales issued, no decertification orders, no cancellations, and 13,513 bales awaiting review.</p>
<p>((-- New York Commodity Desk, 212-859-1640))</p>
</text>
